          "author": {
            "@type": "Person",
            "name": "Gill"
          },
          "reviewBody": "....from Alan, it felt really personalised and I liked the way Alan spent time with each group member and took time to explain. I also felt challenged and pushed beyond my previous comfort zone leading to a greater interest in getting better shots both technically and visually.    It was obvious that Alan had scouted the locations well and had taken the time to ensure that we got the best opportunity to make the most of the landscape of the lakes.",
