        {
          "@type": "Review",
          "author": {
            "@type": "Person",
            "name": "Sarah Vaughan"
          },
          "reviewBody": "This guy knows his stuff! I went on an introductory seminar. He explains basic photography 'science' in a way everyone can understand and provides a handy booklet with start-up information and some tasks to complete to get you going.    I was so impressed that I have now enrolled in the beginners full 4-weeks course and will be attending some of his outdoor workshops so that I can really get to grips with using my new camera and to start to learn the art.",
